---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Quake Watch · Live Earthquake Monitor"
	: "震波守望 · QUAKE WATCH";
const description = isEn
	? "Live multi-source global earthquake monitor aggregating USGS, JMA, and EMSC catalogs with spatio-temporal deduplication, interactive seismic mapping, and confirmed catalog telemetry."
	: "震波守望 · 全球多源实时地震监测仪：汇聚 USGS、日本气象厅（JMA）与欧洲地中海地震中心（EMSC）实时目录，时空去重融合，交互式全球震波图谱。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<slot slot="head" name="head">
		<!-- Leaflet CSS via CDN with SRI -->
		<link
			rel="stylesheet"
			href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css"
			integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY="
			crossorigin=""
		/>
	</slot>

	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#060913] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-rose-500/30 selection:text-rose-200">
			<!-- Ambient Seismic Wave Glow Background -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#ef4444_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-rose-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">全球实时震网 · 60秒自动同步</span>
							<span class="lang-en">GLOBAL SEISMIC NETWORK · 60S AUTO SYNC</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>📡</span>
							<span>USGS · JMA · EMSC</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">多源时空去重确认目录</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Multi-Source Confirmed Catalog</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/quake-watch/" : "/en/projects/quake-watch/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-rose-500/40 text-rose-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-rose-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "Switch to Chinese" : "切换为英文"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">震波守望 · QUAKE WATCH</span>
					<span class="lang-en">QUAKE WATCH · Seismic Monitor</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-rose-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">全球多源实时地震监测仪 · USGS + JMA + EMSC · 跨源去重与时空关联图谱</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Live Multi-Source Earthquake Monitor · USGS + JMA + EMSC · De-duplicated Telemetry</span>
				</p>

				<!-- CONTEXT NOTE -->
				<div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-400 font-mono font-semibold text-xs mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider">
						<span>ℹ️</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">背景与设计说明</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Context & Purpose</span>
					</div>
					<p class="lang-zh">
						2026 年 10 月 16 日，日本气象厅（JMA）紧急地震速报系统因堪察加半岛近海实际 M6.9 地震的算法误判触发了虚警 M9.9 预警。本仪表板受此事件启发而构建，仅聚合展示 USGS、JMA 与 EMSC 的正式确认地震目录（Confirmed Catalog Data），不提供秒级紧急地震速报（EEW），用于跨机构震级对比、时空去重融合与全球震情态势感知。
					</p>
					<p class="lang-en">
						On October 16, 2026, the Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA) Earthquake Early Warning system triggered a false M9.9 alert (the actual event was an M6.9 quake off the Kamchatka Peninsula). Inspired by that incident, this dashboard aggregates and cross-validates confirmed seismic catalog data from USGS, JMA, and EMSC. It presents verified catalog events rather than unconfirmed early warnings.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- STATS HEADER CARDS -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4 mb-4">
					<div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">近 24h 地震 (去重)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Past 24h Quakes</span>
						</div>
						<div id="stat-total-count" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black font-mono text-white">
							<span class="animate-pulse opacity-60">--</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">三大台网联合检出</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Combined catalogs</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">24h 最高震级</span>
							<span class="lang-en">24h Max Magnitude</span>
						</div>
						<div id="stat-max-mag" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black font-mono text-amber-400">
							<span class="animate-pulse opacity-60">--</span>
						</div>
						<div id="stat-max-place" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-1 truncate">
							<span class="lang-zh">等待同步...</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Awaiting sync...</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">强震 (≥ M6.0)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Strong Quakes (≥ M6.0)</span>
						</div>
						<div id="stat-m6-count" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black font-mono text-rose-400">
							<span class="animate-pulse opacity-60">--</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">破坏性地震关注</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Potentially damaging</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
						<div>
							<div class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 flex items-center justify-between">
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">数据源通道</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Sources Status</span>
								</span>
								<span id="sync-indicator" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse" title="Connected"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono mt-1">
								<span id="badge-usgs" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-950 border border-blue-800 text-blue-300">USGS: ...</span>
								<span id="badge-jma" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-rose-950 border border-rose-800 text-rose-300">JMA: ...</span>
								<span id="badge-emsc" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-950 border border-purple-800 text-purple-300">EMSC: ...</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
							<span id="last-updated-text">
								<span class="lang-zh">更新于: 同步中...</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Updated: syncing...</span>
							</span>
							<button
								id="btn-manual-refresh"
								type="button"
								class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-xs font-mono transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1"
								title="Refresh now / 立即刷新"
							>
								<svg id="refresh-icon" class="w-3 h-3 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
									<path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.6-6.4L21 8M21 3v5h-5"/>
								</svg>
								<span class="lang-zh">刷新</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Sync</span>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- CONTROLS & FILTERS ROW -->
				<div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
					<!-- Source toggle chips -->
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<span class="text-slate-400 font-semibold">
							<span class="lang-zh">台网筛选:</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Catalogs:</span>
						</span>
						<button
							id="chip-usgs"
							type="button"
							class="chip-toggle active px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border font-mono transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95 text-blue-300 bg-blue-950/60 border-blue-600"
							data-source="USGS"
						>
							✓ USGS
						</button>
						<button
							id="chip-jma"
							type="button"
							class="chip-toggle active px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border font-mono transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95 text-rose-300 bg-rose-950/60 border-rose-600"
							data-source="JMA"
						>
							✓ JMA (日本)
						</button>
						<button
							id="chip-emsc"
							type="button"
							class="chip-toggle active px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border font-mono transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95 text-purple-300 bg-purple-950/60 border-purple-600"
							data-source="EMSC"
						>
							✓ EMSC (欧洲)
						</button>
					</div>

					<!-- Min Magnitude Slider -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-[200px]">
						<span class="text-slate-400 font-semibold">
							<span class="lang-zh">最低震级:</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Min Mag:</span>
						</span>
						<input
							id="slider-min-mag"
							type="range"
							min="4.0"
							max="8.0"
							step="0.1"
							value="4.0"
							class="accent-rose-500 cursor-pointer h-1.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-lg grow"
						/>
						<span id="label-min-mag" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-amber-300 font-bold min-w-[52px] text-center">
							≥ M4.0
						</span>
					</div>

					<!-- Search input & Opt-in Notification toggle -->
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
						<div class="relative">
							<input
								id="input-search"
								type="text"
								placeholder="搜索地点 / Filter place..."
								class="px-2.5 py-1 pl-7 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-rose-500 transition w-44 sm:w-56"
							/>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 absolute left-2 top-2 pointer-events-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/>
							</svg>
						</div>

						<!-- Notification Toggle -->
						<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition">
							<input
								id="toggle-notifications"
								type="checkbox"
								class="accent-rose-500 cursor-pointer rounded"
							/>
							<span class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]">
								<span class="lang-zh">有 M6.5+ 强震时通知我</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Notify me of M6.5+ quakes</span>
							</span>
						</label>
					</div>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- MAIN CONTENT GRID: MAP + EVENT LIST -->
			<div class="space-y-6">
				<!-- MAP CONTAINER -->
				<div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 shadow-xl">
					<!-- Interactive Map Container -->
					<div id="quake-map" class="w-full h-[460px] z-0"></div>

					<!-- Graceful Degradation Fallback Container -->
					<div
						id="quake-map-fallback"
						class="hidden absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/95 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center z-10"
					>
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3">
							⚠️
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">地图网络加载未就绪 (离线模式)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Map Service Standby (Offline Mode)</span>
						</h3>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-md mb-2">
							<span class="lang-zh">Leaflet CDN 资源不可达或已降级。所有多源地震数据抓取、去重分析、筛选与下方事件列表均完全正常运转。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Leaflet CDN is unreachable or blocked. Data acquisition, deduplication, filtering, and the event list below remain fully functional.</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Map Legend Overlay -->
					<div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 z-[400] p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-800 text-[11px] font-mono shadow-lg pointer-events-auto">
						<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold mb-1.5">
							<span class="lang-zh">震级图例 (圈径/色彩)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Magnitude Scale</span>
						</div>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
								<span class="text-slate-300">&lt; M5.0</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></span>
								<span class="text-slate-300">M5.0–5.9</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500"></span>
								<span class="text-slate-300">M6.0–6.9</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-rose-500 animate-pulse"></span>
								<span class="text-slate-300 font-bold">≥ M7.0</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="mt-2 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
							<button
								id="btn-reset-map-view"
								type="button"
								class="text-[10px] text-rose-400 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer"
							>
								<span class="lang-zh">↺ 视野居中复位</span>
								<span class="lang-en">↺ Reset View</span>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- EVENT LIST SECTION -->
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/70 p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-xl">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-slate-800/80">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></div>
							<h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-sans">
								<span class="lang-zh">地震事件列表 · 最新优先</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Earthquake Catalog · Newest First</span>
							</h2>
							<span id="filtered-count-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
								0 / 0
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
							<span class="lang-zh">点击任意行可在地图上定位并查看详细测报</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Click any row to locate and open details</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Event List Table Container -->
					<div class="overflow-x-auto">
						<table class="w-full text-left text-xs font-mono border-collapse">
							<thead>
								<tr class="text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider">
									<th class="py-2.5 px-3">
										<span class="lang-zh">震级</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Mag</span>
									</th>
									<th class="py-2.5 px-3">
										<span class="lang-zh">发震时间 (当地 / 相对)</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Origin Time</span>
									</th>
									<th class="py-2.5 px-3">
										<span class="lang-zh">震中位置</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Epicenter Location</span>
									</th>
									<th class="py-2.5 px-3">
										<span class="lang-zh">深度</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Depth</span>
									</th>
									<th class="py-2.5 px-3">
										<span class="lang-zh">检出机构</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Sources</span>
									</th>
									<th class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">
										<span class="lang-zh">操作</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Action</span>
									</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody id="quake-table-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-800/40">
								<!-- Initial Skeleton Loading Rows -->
								<tr>
									<td colspan="6" class="py-8 text-center text-slate-500">
										<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
											<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border-2 border-rose-500 border-t-transparent animate-spin"></span>
											<span class="lang-zh">正在连接全球三大地震台网实时数据源并执行跨源去重...</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Connecting to global seismic networks and performing deduplication...</span>
										</div>
									</td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</div>

					<!-- Empty State -->
					<div id="quake-empty-state" class="hidden py-10 text-center text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs">
						<p class="mb-1 text-base">🔍</p>
						<p class="lang-zh">没有找到符合当前筛选条件的地震事件</p>
						<p class="lang-en">No earthquakes match the current filter criteria</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- FOOTER SECTION & AI DECLARATION -->
			<div class="pt-8 mt-8 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2">
				<div>
					<span class="lang-zh">震波守望 · QUAKE WATCH — 2026 全球多源实时地震监测仪表盘</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Quake Watch · 2026 Live Multi-Source Earthquake Dashboard</span>
				</div>
				<div>
					<span>p1ziyu.com · 2026</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<hr class="my-6 border-slate-800" />
			<blockquote class="text-xs opacity-50 border-l-2 border-indigo-500/40 pl-3 py-1 my-4 italic">
				<span class="lang-zh">本文由 AI 生成。</span>
				<span class="lang-en">This article was generated by AI.</span>
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Leaflet JS via CDN with SRI -->
	<script
		is:inline
		src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"
